NimbusVault licensing scope
==========================

The official UCS503P documentation/template scaffold and copied template assets retain the MIT notice in LICENSE.template, copyright Raghav B. Venkataramaiyer. That notice is preserved verbatim.

The historical NimbusVault application LICENSE was empty and is preserved at code/LICENSE; this repository organization does not invent a new blanket application licence. CloudVault-derived portions retain their Apache-2.0 licence and notices in code/LICENSE.cloudvault and code/NOTICE.cloudvault. Qwen and other downloaded model/runtime artefacts have their own licences and are not redistributed here. Academic submissions retain their original authorship.
